濃雞湯拉麵與七段蒜油雞湯拉麵，湯頭的濃淡都可以依照個人喜好調整。最棒的是，店內還提供免費加麵一次的優惠（記得要留半碗湯喔），絕對能讓人吃得飽足又滿意！\n\u200b此外，店家的營業時間為 17:00 - 22:30（週六日為 12:00 - 20:30），特別注意本月週二、四是店休，想來品嚐的朋友千萬別撲空了！非常推薦給熱愛拉麵的大家！",null,[0,194]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3466119962359786272/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYTA1NlNsbFNNV3hSV0RCa2NGa3ljSFJhYW1SWFZtNXdjMXBZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3466119962359786272/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYTA1NlNsbFNNV3hSV0RCa2NGa3ljSFJhYW1SWFZtNXdjMXBZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3466119962359786272/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYTA1NlNsbFNNV3hSV0RCa2NGa3ljSFJhYW1SWFZtNXdjMXBZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3466119962359786272/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYTA1NlNsbFNNV3hSV0RCa2NGa3ljSFJhYW1SWFZtNXdjMXBZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3466119962359786272/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYTA1NlNsbFNNV3hSV0RCa2NGa3ljSFJhYW1SWFZtNXdjMXBZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3466119962359786272/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBvYTA1NlNsbFNNV3hSV0RCa2NGa3ljSFJhYW1SWFZtNXdjMXBZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,728,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poa056SllSMWxRWDBkcFkycHRaamRXVm5wc1pYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x5b1af2860646c79a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjhkNzJYR1lQX0dpY2ptZjdWVnpsZXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poa056SllSMWxRWDBkcFkycHRaamRXVm5wc1pYYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poa056SllSMWxRWDBkcFkycHRaamRXVm5wc1pYYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poa056SllSMWxRWDBkcFkycHRaamRXVm5wc1pYYxILMGVDWDBWMExRTkUaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09qaGtOekpZUjFsUVgwZHBZMnB0WmpkV1ZucHN